se only on the same side as the tumour.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote11"><label>c</label><p>Lower limit 1.5 years ago because regular phone use defined as phone use of at least 6 months' duration at least 1 year prior to the reference date.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote12"><label>d</label><p><italic>P</italic>&#x0003c;0.01.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote13"><label>e</label><p><italic>P</italic>&#x0003c;0.05.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote14"><label>f</label><p>Classification based on the distribution among controls who were users. Data were divided into &#x0003c;119, 119&#x02013;593 and &#x0003e;593 for ipsilateral use, and &#x0003c;122, 122&#x02013;534 and &#x0003e;534 for contralateral use.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>